    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the wealthy elite have abandon a dying earth, the survivors focus their last hope of survival on their newly discovered &quot;<i>Quantum Canon</i>&quot; technology. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As humanity dwindles the Earth, using gathered energy amassed  over years,  may send a single augmented-human explorer to a seemingly uninhabited, distant living-world dubbed &quot;New Pangea&quot;. Their they hope their here can build the &quot;<i>Quantum Gate Terminus</i>&quot; to\u00a0 allow the remains of humanity to flee to this new home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Explorers job is simple: Without Tools or Resources,\u00a0<strong>Naked</strong> and <strong>Alone</strong> (Except for your helpful ocular mounted AI companion &quot;<i>ALAI</i>&quot;):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> this new world and learn it's secrets and history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong>\u00a0privation and isolation of the eerily familiar planet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> your way from stone age technology to height of technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn</strong> from previous failed &quot;Quantum Gate Jump&quot; by retaining upgrades and perks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
